!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = For CRISPR screen, sgRNA sequences were amplified by PCR following the previously described procedure (Joung et al, 2017, Nat Protoc); For eCLIP, libraries were constructed using the RBP-eCLIP kit (ECLIPSEbio) according to the manufacturer's instructions.
!Sample_description = paired-end sequencing was performed but only read1 was used
!Sample_data_processing = demultiplex
